/Title (This document provides a detailed low-level design of a Honeypot Network system tailored for a Healthcare environment. The goal is to design a system that detects and logs unauthorised network access attempts, mimicking a real healthcare server to gather threat intelligence.  The system focuses on maintaining the integrity, confidentiality, and availability of the healthcare  network by identifying and logging suspicious connection attempts in real time.)
